          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The drive": {
      "localizations": {
        "hi": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "अभियान"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The first before/after in India could be yours.": {
      "localizations": {
        "hi": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "भारत की पहली पहले/बाद की फ़ोटो आपकी हो सकती है।"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The linked spot will also be marked as cleaned with these photos.": {
      "localizations": {
        "hi": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "जुड़ी हुई जगह भी इन फ़ोटो के साथ साफ़ चिह्नित हो जाएगी।"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The podium is empty": {
      "localizations": {
        "hi": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "पोडियम ख़ाली है"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The spot we're cleaning": {
      "localizations": {
        "hi": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "जिस जगह की सफ़ाई होगी"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This account may have been deleted.": {
      "localizations": {
        "hi": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "शायद यह खाता हटा दिया गया है।"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This can't be undone. Your points, badges, reports and comments will be removed.": {
      "localizations": {
        "hi": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "इसे वापस नहीं किया जा सकता। आपके पॉइंट्स, बैज, रिपोर्ट और टिप्पणियाँ हट जाएँगी।"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This is a health hazard for residents and spoils our neighbourhood. I request you to kindly get it cleared at the earliest and arrange regular collection so it doesn't pile up again.": {
      "localizations": {
        "hi": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "यह निवासियों के स्वास्थ्य के लिए ख़तरा है और हमारे मोहल्ले को ख़राब करता है। कृपया इसे जल्द से जल्द साफ़ करवाएँ और नियमित कचरा उठाने की व्यवस्था करें ताकि यह फिर जमा न हो।"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This spot at %@ needs cleaning. Can you help? %@": {
      "localizations": {
        "hi": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "%1$@ की इस जगह को सफ़ाई चाहिए। क्या आप मदद करेंगे? %2$@"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This week": {
      "localizations": {
        "hi": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "इस हफ़्ते"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Tips that get results": {
      "localizations": {
        "hi": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "असरदार सुझाव"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "To,\nThe Commissioner / Ward Officer,\nMunicipal Corporation": {
      "localizations": {
        "hi": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "सेवा में,\nआयुक्त / वार्ड अधिकारी,\nनगर निगम"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Tomorrow: %@. Keep gloves, water and a cap ready!": {
      "localizations": {
        "hi": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "कल: %@। दस्ताने, पानी और टोपी तैयार रखें!"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Top cleaners this week": {
